ess: view and edit scripts within the game, which is useful for learning how things work or testing your own changes\n\n4. remote monitoring: track remote events and functions, including their parameters and calls, making it great for debugging\n\n5. class and instance Creation: create new instances or modify existing ones dynamically during gameplay\n\n6. gui analysis: inspect and edit GUI elements to understand how interfaces are built\n\n7. object duplication: clone parts of the game for testing or analysis\n\ncredits, huge shoutout to them:\ncreated by moon\nmodified by/for Infinite Yield","tags":["dex","dex Explorer","Universal","hack","remote"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766","username":"woops","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/24468b7e5c4fdd7a476a59ae6ae33e15a935ffcc03b3d1fe7785cf86e1b2323f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766-1763165632270.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/24468b7e5c4fdd7a476a59ae6ae33e15a935ffcc03b3d1fe7785cf86e1b2323f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766-1763165632270.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T17:58:06.486Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4ddb8","editBy":{"_id":"66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766","username":"woops","status":"offline","id":"66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-23T22:43:46.613Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e7b360710ec3c55ec6","editBy":{"_id":"66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766","username":"woops","status":"offline","id":"66a1685f0c7532bd92ad8766"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T23:12:14